{"4244270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dice Shaper", "steam_appid": 4244270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for role-playing game players, board game fans, game masters, or anyone who needs fast, reliable, and visually satisfying dice rolls, <strong>Dice Shaper </strong>is the perfect tool!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 <strong>Roll any type of dice</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, d20, coins, and special dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-dice combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics for true randomness<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/3eeddeb6ecca25a86cc7c589a6516025.poster.avif?t=1774464853\" width=606 height=187 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/3eeddeb6ecca25a86cc7c589a6516025.webm?t=1774464853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ <strong>Features built for RPGs</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your roll results in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the history of the last ten rolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add bonuses or penalties before rolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share results with all your friends in one click</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ <strong>Powerful macros</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorite dice combinations</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 <strong>Customizable themes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a theme that fits your style: Classic / Retro, Cyberpunk, Lovecraft, and more<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/c845d4a6ee0f52564b4775120d1d727a.poster.avif?t=1774464853\" width=606 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/c845d4a6ee0f52564b4775120d1d727a.webm?t=1774464853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/c845d4a6ee0f52564b4775120d1d727a.mp4?t=1774464853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 <strong>Customizable boards</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexagonal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ <strong>Clear &amp; accessible interface</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn and use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with mouse and keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully optimized for Steam Deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone support for voice-controlled rolls <i>(for Goblins and Barbarians)</i><br><br><br><br><i></i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/569ac40717d8e4aff0d15ddd9971440e.poster.avif?t=1774464853\" width=606 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/569ac40717d8e4aff0d15ddd9971440e.webm?t=1774464853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/569ac40717d8e4aff0d15ddd9971440e.mp4?t=1774464853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🟦 <strong>Ideal for</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG sessions (D&amp;D, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game masters who want beautiful, visible rolls for their players<br>Streamers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players looking for a simple, stylish, and complete tool</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From basic rolls to full RPG dice sets, <strong>Dice Shaper </strong>adapts to all your needs, <strong>the ultimate dice roller.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music composed by Raphaël Rodriguez</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for role-playing game players, board game fans, game masters, or anyone who needs fast, reliable, and visually satisfying dice rolls, <strong>Dice Shaper </strong>is the perfect tool!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 <strong>Roll any type of dice</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, d20, coins, and special dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-dice combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics for true randomness<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/3eeddeb6ecca25a86cc7c589a6516025.poster.avif?t=1774464853\" width=606 height=187 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244270/extras/3eeddeb6ecca25a86cc7c589a6516025.webm?t=1774464853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ <strong>Features built for RPGs</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your roll results in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the history of the last ten